[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 7201.629, "timestamp": "02:00:01", "text": "传说中的Q技能是用来制造……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7204.149, "timestamp": "02:00:04", "text": "你把这种排队能力叫做什么？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7208.069, "timestamp": "02:00:08", "text": "再次问：这是什么？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7213.27, "timestamp": "02:00:13", "text": "进入墙内的传送门"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7216.109, "timestamp": "02:00:16", "text": "建筑物，所以显然呃，就让它这样吧。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7219.55, "timestamp": "02:00:19", "text": "再次充电大约需要23分钟。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7223.03, "timestamp": "02:00:23", "text": "24秒，我没数。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7230.03, "timestamp": "02:00:30", "text": "嗯，我得去拿我的瞄准器，等等"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7232.229, "timestamp": "02:00:32", "text": "他们就是这样做的，还是一直都是这样？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7234.87, "timestamp": "02:00:34", "text": "就像这个盾牌"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7239.229, "timestamp": "02:00:39", "text": "核心H，所以在单人游戏模式中你会得到"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7243.629, "timestamp": "02:00:43", "text": "就像紫色的大 Evo 现金现金和"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 7245.777, "timestamp": "02:00:45", "author": "@Solar07910", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/j5v2GtdHe5Mb397GDb3gC5IoevB6pG5og12wcUK7kXFCbhNgN7R_gyWKDv5Ctf9yda4r1JuD1w=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "HELLLOOO"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 7248.963, "timestamp": "02:00:48", "author": "@KonztellionHelper", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/GocLQxiJeUhcpFBwOECdYbCqbqHlCvz1B8j2gnfHQ1Q3AM1kFQ-eKqoi6TpMpyuxId3-6U94bcI=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "Shhh... Solar alt, Joq is resting. 🌙 Welcome to the Guild, and enjoy the past joq's memories!"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7249.83, "timestamp": "02:00:49", "text": "还有，嗯，还有像蓝色 Evo 缓存一样的东西"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7251.99, "timestamp": "02:00:51", "text": "也就是说，它更像是小的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7254.149, "timestamp": "02:00:54", "text": "小盾和大盾之类的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7258.39, "timestamp": "02:00:58", "text": "嗯